# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CHANGE THIS FLAG
#
# PORTFOLIO_CONTENT_MODE is the single setting that controls what a case-study
# build contains. It is read by vite.config.js at build time only - it is never
# exposed to the browser and there is no runtime toggle.
#
#   public   -> publicly deployable build. Internal-only case-study sections
#               (and all of their prose, tables and Mermaid diagrams) are never
#               imported, so they cannot appear in build/ in any form.
#   internal -> private build containing the complete case studies.
#               Output goes to build-internal/ - NEVER DEPLOY THIS DIRECTORY.
#
# npm run dev ignores this flag and always shows every section.
#
# Missing value  -> fails closed to "public".
# Any other value -> the build aborts with an error.
#
# Output directories: public -> build/  ·  internal -> build-internal/
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
PORTFOLIO_CONTENT_MODE=public
